Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.43,0:01:34.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Orienteering!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.56,0:01:37.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{They said we can get started!}¡Dijeron que ya podemos comenzar!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.89,0:01:41.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why are you so peppy today?}{¿Por qué estás tan llena de vida hoy?}¿Por qué estás tan animada?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.85,0:01:44.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm trying to leave all that moping behind me!}¡Estoy tratando de dejar atrás todo lo malo!{}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.70,0:01:49.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{All you're accomplishing is getting yourself lumped in with Kominato.}Lo único que logras es que Kominato se emocione.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.25,0:01:52.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡{\i1}{Hyper goin' now, yo yo yo!}Hyper{\i0\fscx190} {\fscx100}vamos, {\i1}yo yo yo{\i0\fscx45} {\r}!{AHR #04 [0:23:27.63]}{lo hamo <2 me mata xD}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.63,0:01:55.80,AoHaru alt,,0,0,20,,{\i1\an8}Super orienteering!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.33,0:01:56.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll get you into the groove in no time!}¡Haré que te sientas igual en poco tiempo!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.50,0:01:57.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just you wait!}¡Tan solo espera!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.53,0:02:00.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'd really rather you didn't.}Preferiría que no lo hicieras.{suena a que es molesta noma'}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.39,0:02:02.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's go!}¡Vayamos!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.33,0:02:03.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah!}¡Sí!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.29,0:02:06.81,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{No doing this half-hearted.}Me esforzaré.{audio}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.43,0:02:10.18,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm going to make the whole team get along.}Haré que todos se lleven bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.73,0:02:11.73,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8)}{This way!}¡Por aquí!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.02,0:02:13.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{We have to come together.}Tenemos que estar juntos.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.71,0:02:17.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Y a partir de eso, podremos reiniciar,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.61,0:02:19.91,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{and open up a new page!}¡y comenzar una nueva página!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.19,0:02:26.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Look, we found a checkpoint!}¡Miren, encontramos un punto control!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.29,0:02:28.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, you made it.}Ah, {aquí están.}ya llegaron.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.36,0:02:32.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The challenge here is to guess what we've mixed into this juice.}El reto aquí es adivinar qué hemos puesto en estos jugos.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.84,0:02:35.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{There are five ingredients.}Hay cinco ingredientes.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.30,0:02:38.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You get one point for each correct answer.}Obtendrán un punto por cada acierto.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.63,0:02:41.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The obvious ones are apple and banana.}Estoy segura que este es de manzana y plátano.{platano, banano?}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.22,0:02:45.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What else could be in it?}¿Qué más podría tener?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.00,0:02:50.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Something happened to Mabuchi.}Algo le pasó a Mabuchi.{"La cara de Mabuchi se ve rara." Eso escucho D;}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.40,0:02:52.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's wrong, Kou?}¿Qué pasó, Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.02,0:02:54.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It tastes like celery.}Tiene sabor a apio.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.11,0:02:55.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wait, seriously?}¿Qué? ¿En serio?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.02,0:02:59.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I can't tell...}No sabría decirlo...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.61,0:03:01.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's definitely in there.}Estoy seguro.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.53,0:03:04.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Do you hate celery or something?}¿No te gusta el apio, Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.25,0:03:06.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That reaction has me believing.}Esa reacción parece confirmarlo.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.54,0:03:13.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No fair, Murao-san! C'mon and drink your share.}¡No es justo, Murao-san! Ven a beber también.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.59,0:03:26.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's all safe to drink, right?}Todo lo que usaron es bebible, ¿cierto?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.63,0:03:30.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Of course! I made it myself.}¡Por supuesto! Yo mismo lo hice.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.67,0:03:37.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thyme.}Tomillo.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.10,0:03:41.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What, you want more time?}¿Qué? ¿Quieres más tiempo? {tomillo y tiempo se dicen parecido, creo.}{Ç}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.01,0:03:43.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No, I mean, there's thyme in it.}No, solo digo que hay tomillo en el jugo.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.66,0:03:44.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thyme?}¿Tomillo?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.66,0:03:47.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, the spice!}¡Oh, la especia!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.87,0:03:52.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wow! You're the first team to get celery and thyme.}¡Increíble! Son el primer equipo que adivina el apio y tomillo.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.57,0:03:54.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're the leaders so far.}Van primeros por ahora.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.78,0:04:01.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Here's your point card and the first keyword.}Aquí tienen su tarjeta de puntos y su primer palabra clave.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.01,0:04:03.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Be sure to collect them all.}Asegúrense de juntarlas{juntar} todas.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.12,0:04:03.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Roger!}¡Sí!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.30,0:04:08.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey... do you think we could actually win this?}Oye, ¿crees que podamos ganar esto?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.59,0:04:09.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We totally could!}¡Seguramente!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.27,0:04:12.64,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Do the others look up for it?}¿Querrán eso los demás?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.64,0:04:14.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's sweltering.}Hace calor.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.12,0:04:16.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm ready.}Estoy lista.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.73,0:04:22.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I feel like we're finally on the same page!}¡Siento que por fin estamos en la misma página!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.57,0:04:25.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah! Let's get to work!}¡Sí! ¡Pongamos manos a la obra!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.45,0:04:28.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, wait up!}¡Oye, espera!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.47,0:04:30.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We need to follow the map.}Necesitamos seguir el mapa.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.46,0:04:35.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yoshioka, take a good look at those smiles over there.}Yoshioka, mira bien esas sonrisas de allí.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.24,0:04:40.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8\Where could those smiles lead but a checkpoint?}{}¡Esas sonrisas solamente muestran que estuvieron en un punto de control!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.96,0:04:43.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go go go!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.20,0:04:46.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{G-Guys, wait! Look at the map!}¡E-Esperen, chicos! ¡Debemos ver el mapa!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.71,0:04:50.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I have a hunch the next one's this way!}¡Presiento que el próximo es por acá!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.73,0:04:52.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Come on! We have to follow the map!}¡Vamos! ¡Hay que seguir el mapa!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.14,0:04:56.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{This way!}¡Por aquí!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.52,0:04:58.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey! Map!}¡Oigan! ¡El mapa!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.82,0:05:02.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That way!}¡Por ahí!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.66,0:05:05.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Map...}El mapa...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.74,0:05:10.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Isn't that the last checkpoint?}¿Será el último punto de control?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.40,0:05:12.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, finally here.}Sí, por fin llegamos.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.73,0:05:17.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I feel so useless...}Me siento tan inútil...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.04,0:05:28.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Have you told Yoshioka-san about what you saw yesterday?}¿Le contaste a Yoshioka-san lo que viste ayer?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.79,0:05:30.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Should I have?}¿Debería hacerlo?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.45,0:05:35.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't worry, I haven't said a word.}No te preocupes, no dije ni una palabra.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.82,0:05:40.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But I don't think Futaba-chan would tell anyone even if she knew.}Pero aun si Futaba-chan lo supiera, \Nno creo que se lo contaría a alguien más.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.44,0:05:44.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's up? Talking about something fun?}¿Qué sucede? ¿Hablan de algo divertido?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.38,0:05:51.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's nothing, Futaba-chan.}No es nada, Futaba-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.41,0:05:53.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Okay then!}¡Ya veo!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.71,0:05:58.37,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Hearing that makes it hard to keep pressing her.}Si dice eso, no puedo presionarla a más.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.32,0:06:03.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Guess I still can't bring myself to say what I really want to.}Supongo que todavía no puedo decir lo que realmente quiero.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.84,0:06:06.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Wait, this is no time to hesitate.}Espera, no es momento para estar dudando.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.57,0:06:09.96,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Changing that part of me is exactly what I'm working towards right now!}¡Cambiar cosas de mí es exactamente por lo que estoy trabajando duro ahora!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.96,0:06:10.85,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Let's move on!}¡Sigamos adelante!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.17,0:06:15.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Nice, we got all the keywords!}¡Bien, obtuvimos todas las palabras claves!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.81,0:06:19.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh, so they want us to put them in order?}Entonces ¿nosotros debemos ordenarlas?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.71,0:06:23.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The biggest lake?}¿El lago más grande?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.09,0:06:26.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That must be the goal!}¡Esa debe ser la meta!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.78,0:06:31.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Look! Right there!}¡Miren! ¡Aquí!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.23,0:06:35.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We have plenty of points, and we're doing great on time.}Tenemos un montón de puntos, \Ny estamos muy bien de tiempo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.75,0:06:38.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Could we really do it?}¿De verdad lo conseguiremos?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.58,0:06:41.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's go!}¡Vamos!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.66,0:06:47.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So, uh, where are we?}Este... ¿dónde estamos?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.96,0:06:52.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We ran around randomly, so we have no idea where we are.}Corrimos de un lado a otro sin sentido,\N no tenemos idea de dónde estamos.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.18,0:06:54.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I know! We can use our smartphones!}¡Ya sé! ¡Podemos usar nuestros celulares!{teléfono/celular}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.67,0:06:56.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We had to leave them with the teachers, remember?}Tuvimos que dejárselos a los maestros, ¿recuerdas?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.07,0:06:59.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Now what?}¿Qué haremos?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.81,0:07:06.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{No problem! We can go by the terrain around us, the shape of the mountains, and the location of the sun.}No problem!{\i0} Podemos seguir estos caminos, \Nla forma de las montañas, y la posición del sol.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.11,0:07:08.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{This is what orienteering is all about!}¡Para eso es la orientación!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.19,0:07:23.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We're completely lost.}Estamos completamente perdidos.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.10,0:07:30.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Qué problema.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.68,0:07:34.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What? You tryin' to say it's my fault?}¿Qué? ¿Tratas de decir que todo es mi culpa?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.20,0:07:36.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I said nothing of the sort.}No dije nada como eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.01,0:07:38.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You all agreed to follow me!}¡Estuvieron de acuerdo en seguirme!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.68,0:07:41.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I told you, that's not what I said.}Te dije que no dije algo como eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.19,0:07:43.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{This is no time to be fighting.}¡Este no es momento para discutir!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.38,0:07:45.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We need to get out of the forest, and fast.}Tenemos que salir del bosque, y rápido.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.26,0:07:52.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's not all that large, so I'm sure we can make it out if we keep moving.}No es tan grande, estoy seguro que podemos salir si nos mantenemos en movimiento.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.87,0:07:54.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But...}Pero...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.53,0:07:57.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Is it really a good idea to wander around like that?}¿en verdad es buena idea vagar en el bosque?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.66,0:08:03.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Shouldn't we just wait here for the teachers to come fi nd us?}¿No deberíamos esperar aquí a\N que los maestros nos encuentren?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.36,0:08:07.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I hear a river.}Escucho un río.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.78,0:08:18.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Considering the lake we're looking for should be that direction, there's probably a way out, too.}Teniendo en cuenta que el lago que buscamos debe estar en esa dirección, probablemente también haya una salida.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.74,0:08:22.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's go as far as we can while it's still light out.}Seguiremos mientras todavía quede luz del día.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.57,0:08:28.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{If we can't escape by sunset, then we'll stop and wait, like Makita suggested.}Si no logramos salir para la puesta del sol,\N nos detendremos y esperaremos, como Makita sugirió.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.64,0:08:30.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How's that sound?}¿Les parece?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.84,0:08:34.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't you worry. We're all in this together.}No te preocupes. Estaremos bien juntos.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.08,0:08:41.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Check it out, it's the river!}¡Miren esto, es el río!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.75,0:08:45.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The current's pretty slow, so we can make it across.}La corriente no es fuerte, podremos pasar sin problemas.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.73,0:08:46.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's go.}Vamos.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.09,0:09:03.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Easy as pie!}¡Qué fácil!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.75,0:09:10.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't relax until you're safely across.}No te relajes hasta cruzarlo por completo.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.21,0:09:12.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That really gave me a start.}Me asustó mucho.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.20,0:09:14.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yuuri, be careful!}¡Yuuri, ten cuidado!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.99,0:09:19.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm scared! I can't do it!}¡Tengo miedo! ¡No puedo hacerlo!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.68,0:09:22.04,AoHaru alt,,0,0,95,,{\alpha&H40&\shad0}{Take your time!}¡Tómate tu tiempo!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:19.68,0:09:22.04,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H10&\shad0}{Just take it step by step.}Simplemente hazlo paso a paso.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:19.68,0:09:22.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1E4409&\alpha&H10&\shad0}{Sprint as fast as you can!}¡Corre lo más rápido que puedas!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.04,0:09:24.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't all talk at once!}¡No hablen todos a la vez!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.51,0:09:27.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What is she doing?}¿Qué está haciendo?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.49,0:09:29.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Makita!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.95,0:09:32.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Here, grab on.}Ven, agárrate.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.45,0:09:34.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But I'm scared...}Pero tengo miedo...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.73,0:09:36.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just give me your hand already.}Solo dame tu mano.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.54,0:09:38.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Here.}Vamos.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.24,0:09:41.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll fall I'll fall!}¡Me caeré!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.52,0:09:44.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Lo ves?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.68,0:09:50.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You can make it across.}Ahora puedes cruzar.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.93,0:09:55.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Can't you?}¿Verdad?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.95,0:10:03.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Makita, keep at it!}¡Makita, sigue así!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.61,0:10:07.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Kou, you really amaze me.}Kou, realmente me sorprendes.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.33,0:10:10.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{You completely calmed Yuuri down.}Pudiste calmar completamente a Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.62,0:10:14.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You did really well.}Lo hiciste muy bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.26,0:10:16.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks, Mabuchi-kun.}Gracias, Mabuchi-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.94,0:10:17.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sure.}Claro.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.75,0:10:22.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry I made you all worry.}Lo siento, hice que se preocuparan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.08,0:10:24.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm just glad you're safe.}Me alegra que estés a salvo.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.62,0:10:26.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Alright, let's get moving.}Muy bien, sigamos.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.27,0:10:28.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah!}¡Sí!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.60,0:10:34.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We should probably speed it up.}Creo que debemos apresurarnos.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.63,0:10:40.76,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Uh oh... I think I hurt my foot when I fell.}Qué mal... creo que me lastimé el pie cuando me caí.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.76,0:10:43.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{It hurts like hell to walk!}¡Me duele demasiado!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Did you hurt your foot?}¿Te lastimaste el pie?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.26,0:11:02.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No way, not at all!}¡Ah, no, para nada!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.93,0:11:04.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You hurt your foot.}Te lastimaste, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.97,0:11:08.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Was it at the river?}¿Pasó en el río?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.98,0:11:10.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.56,0:11:14.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll find the way out and bring the teachers back.}Encontraré una salida y traeré de vuelta a los maestros.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.03,0:11:19.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It'll be dark soon, so there's no time to waste.}Pronto oscurecerá, no hay tiempo que perder.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.61,0:11:21.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It'd be even worse to split up here.}No creo que sea bueno dividirnos.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.57,0:11:25.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The worst-case scenario is if it gets dark before you find a way out.}Sería muy malo si oscurece mientras buscas una salida.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.08,0:11:31.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't worry about me! Let's just get out of here.}¡No se preocupen por mí! ¡Salgamos de aquí!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.71,0:11:35.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kominato, hold this for me.}Kominato, sostén esto.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.67,0:11:39.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Get on.}Vamos.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.13,0:11:43.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll carry you back.}Yo te llevaré.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.60,0:11:46.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No, it's embarrassing!}¡No, es embarazoso!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.51,0:11:49.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tú no tienes lo necesario por\N lo cual puedas avergonzarte.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.23,0:11:53.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Get on or you'll just be slowing the rest of us down.}Súbete o harás que todos vayamos lento.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.86,0:12:00.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Futaba-chan, I'll hold your bag.}Futaba-chan, yo llevaré tu bolso.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.61,0:12:02.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, thanks.}Ah, bueno.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.70,0:12:06.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Then, I'll take you up on your offer...}Entonces, aceptaré tu oferta...{tomaré tu palabra :3}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.99,0:12:10.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,E-Estoy pesada.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.75,0:12:12.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Shut up and get on.}Ya súbete.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.12,0:12:15.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You were right.}Era verdad.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.46,0:12:17.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{A-Aren't I? Let me down and I'll walk!}¿V-Ves? ¡Bájame e iré caminado!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.13,0:12:25.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I don't mind. The extra weight makes you feel more real in my hands.}No te preocupes. Este peso hace sentir más real que te tengo en mis manos.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.60,0:12:28.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Weird response.}Dices cosas raras.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.01,0:12:35.48,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But he doesn't seem to disapprove of me being here, so I have that.}Pero no pareciera molestarle esto, así que bueno.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.98,0:12:38.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Weirdo...}Qué raro...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.74,0:12:44.11,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{He's warm.}Es cálido.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.07,0:12:46.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I can smell Kou.}Puedo oler a Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.58,0:13:37.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.96,0:13:39.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Are you still awake?}¿Sigues despierta?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.84,0:13:42.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, I'm up.}Sí, sigo despierta.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.71,0:13:46.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{A lot went wrong today, but it sure was fun.}Varias cosas salieron mal hoy, \Npero creo que fue muy divertido.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.55,0:13:49.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah! Too bad we ended up finishing last.}¡Sí! Lástima que no llegamos primeros.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.85,0:13:52.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So, hey...}Oye...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.73,0:13:57.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Back in the middle of orienteering...}durante la orientación...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.85,0:14:00.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,tú y Murao-san estaban...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.53,0:14:05.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Never mind.}No es nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.91,0:14:10.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Futaba-chan, listen.}Futaba-chan, escucha.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.87,0:14:16.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I've always tended to keep to myself, but it's not like I didn't get lonely.}Siempre tendí a apartarme del resto por mí misma, pero no es que no me sintiera sola.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.71,0:14:21.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{When you talked to me that day,}Cuando me hablaste ese día,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.71,0:14:24.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{can you imagine just how happy I was?}¿sabes cuán feliz me hiciste?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.05,0:14:26.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That's why...}Por eso...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.68,0:14:34.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll never leave you alone. I promise.}Nunca te dejaré sola. Lo prometo.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.44,0:14:43.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Me too! I understand just how much it hurts to be alone.}¡Yo también! Entiendo qué se siente estar sola.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.11,0:14:51.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll always be your friend, no matter what.}Por eso seré tu amiga, sin importar qué.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.12,0:14:53.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks!}¡Sí!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.23,0:15:20.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.90,0:15:25.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.32,0:15:27.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.82,0:15:30.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What are you doing out this early?}¿Qué haces aquí tan temprano?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.65,0:15:34.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I couldn't get back to sleep, so I figured I'd watch the sunrise.}No pude volver a dormirme, \Nasí que pensé que podía ver el amanecer.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.08,0:15:38.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How's your ankle?}¿Cómo está tu tobillo?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.37,0:15:41.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I feel fine now. The painkillers are helping.}Me siento bien ahora. Los medicamentos ayudaron.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.12,0:15:43.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That's good.}Ya veo.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.92,0:15:47.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No hay más que unos ligeros matices de luz.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.55,0:15:50.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I can't tell whether it's night or day.}No sabría decir si es de noche o de día.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.09,0:15:55.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{For some reason, it reminds me of you.}Por alguna razón, me recuerda a ti.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.80,0:15:57.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What part?}¿En qué sentido?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.06,0:16:00.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I can't tell whether you're kind or mean.}No sé si eres amable o no.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.31,0:16:03.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That makes two of us.}Entonces ya somos dos.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.69,0:16:07.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I can't tell if you're incompetent or courageous.}No sé si eres incompetente o valiente.{"No sé si vives del pasado o intentas avanzar." me hubiera gustado </3}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.66,0:16:17.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Caught between night and day,}Atrapados entre el día y la noche.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.08,0:16:19.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{just like us.}Así estamos.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.96,0:16:29.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's pretty chilly, so put that on.}Úsalo, está comenzando a hacer frío.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.09,0:16:32.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Won't you get cold then?}¿Pero no tendrás frío tú?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.13,0:16:34.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm alright.}Estoy bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.26,0:16:36.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks.}Gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.60,0:16:39.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We still have some time before the sun rises.}Todavía falta un rato para que salga el sol.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.64,0:16:41.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I know!}¡Ya sé!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.15,0:16:53.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Man, you totally beat us here!}¡Vaya, nos ganaron!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.16,0:16:58.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey...}Cielos...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.33,0:17:02.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Did you seriously not grab a jacket when you were in your room?}¿En serio fuiste a tu cuarto y no te trajiste un abrigo?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.12,0:17:06.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry! Here, I'll give it back.}¡Cierto! Toma, te lo devuelvo.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.38,0:17:07.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Forget it.}Está bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.88,0:17:10.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You can keep it on.}Puedes seguir usándolo.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.07,0:17:36.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Alright, here it comes! Almost here!}¡Muy bien, aquí viene! ¡Aquí viene!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.95,0:17:40.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's here!}¡Llegó!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.49,0:17:44.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Daybreak.}El amanecer.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.00,0:17:47.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The beginning of a new day.}El comienzo de un nuevo día.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.00,0:17:52.92,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{The scent of damp ground.}El aroma de la tierra húmeda.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.55,0:17:55.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{The scent of morning dew.}El aroma del rocío.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.63,0:17:57.59,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{The scent of a May morning.}El aroma de una mañana de mayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.09,0:18:05.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I don't think I'll ever forget watching this sunrise with everyone.}No creo que alguna vez vaya a olvidar este amanecer.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.27,0:18:08.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{One day, when we look back on this...}Un día, cuando miremos atrás,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.23,0:18:12.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I want everyone who shared this experience}quiero que todos los que compartieron esta experiencia
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.73,0:18:16.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{to remember these fun and warm times.}recuerden lo cálido y divertido que fue.{AHR #04 [0:10:59.84]}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.03,0:18:21.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I really like that line. It completely embodies what adolescence is all about.}Me encanta esa frase. \NRepresenta perfectamente lo que es la adolescencia.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.99,0:18:23.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You really feel no shame.}Tú en verdad no sientes vergüenza.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.00,0:18:27.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{If you get embarrassed, you lose, man.}Si te avergüenzas, pierdes.{.-.}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.37,0:18:35.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't lose your passion until you're old and wrinkled!}¡No debes perder la pasión hasta que estés viejo y arrugado!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.38,0:18:38.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And I doubt you ever will.}Dudo que llegues a cambiar.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.11,0:18:55.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Anyone forget anything? If not, we're leaving.}¿Alguien olvida algo? Sino, partiremos ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.49,0:19:05.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{They're crushing me!}¡Me aplastan!{acortaron mucho esta parte ;_;}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.46,0:19:14.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah. Thanks a lot.}Sí. Muchas gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.92,0:19:18.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{My mom's coming to pick me up.}Mi mamá vendrá a recogerme.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.72,0:19:19.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I see.}Ya veo.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.30,0:19:27.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It doesn't even hurt that much.}Ya no me duele tanto.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.77,0:19:30.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Still, you shouldn't push it.}Bueno, no deberías esforzarte de más.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.73,0:19:32.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, you're right.}Sí, es verdad.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.82,0:19:36.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou, aren't you going home?}Kou, ¿no irás a tu casa?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.40,0:19:37.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, a cat.}Oh, un gato.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.61,0:19:44.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't tell me... you're going to keep me company?}¿No me digas que... me harás compañía?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't worry about it, you can go—}No te preocupes por mí, puedes ir—
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.70,0:19:49.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Look!}¡Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.29,0:19:53.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Check it out. He's only got one sock on.}Míralo. Solo tiene un calcetín.{calcetín pls, ¿se usa "media" en otros paises?}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.26,0:20:05.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He's still just a kitty.}Todavía es pequeño, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.76,0:20:07.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wonder if he's stray.}Me pregunto si se perdió.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.31,0:20:08.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Seems to like people, though.}Aunque parecen gustarle las personas.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.43,0:20:13.15,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm learning more about Kou.}Estoy aprendiendo más acerca de Kou.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.15,0:20:14.48,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{He hates celery.}Odia el apio.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.40,0:20:16.69,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{He likes cats.}Le gustan los gatos.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.90,0:20:20.19,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{He may have a rough way of speaking,}Puede ser muy grosero al hablar,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.90,0:20:22.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{but in reality...}pero en verdad...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.82,0:20:23.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...he's gentle.}...es gentil.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.41,0:20:31.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{My ride's here.}Ya llegaron por mí.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.04,0:20:37.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Guess I'll head back too.}Supongo que me iré también.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.59,0:20:38.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Later.}Nos vemos.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.59,0:20:42.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.05,0:20:45.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks for waiting with me.}Gracias por esperar conmigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.89,0:20:49.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh? I was just playing with that cat.}¿Eh? Solo estaba jugando con el gato.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.77,0:20:52.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That's what I thought you'd say!}¡Sabía que dirías algo así!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.85,0:20:58.82,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{He's no longer the Kou I remember. Both his voice and height have changed.}Él ya no es el Kou que recuerdo. \NSu voz y altura han cambiado.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.90,0:21:02.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But now I can say I know...}Pero ahora puedo decir que conozco...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.11,0:21:05.53,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...the sixteen-year-old Kou.}...al Kou de dieciséis años.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.62,0:21:09.74,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{The one who made my heart skip a beat...}Quien hizo que mi corazón se acelerara...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.37,0:21:13.12,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...was the sixteen-year-old Kou.}...fue el Kou de dieciséis años.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.33,0:21:17.71,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Have I fallen in love with...}¿Me habré enamorado de Kou...?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.14,0:21:28.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{A text from Yuuri.}Un mensaje de Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.60,0:21:37.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{"I'm not even mad at Kominato-kun anymore."}"Ya ni siquiera estoy enojada con Kominato-kun".
