Dialogue: 10,0:23:25.55,0:23:31.84,AoHaru,,0,520,0,,{The first time I realized my feelings was when he helped me cross that river.}{\q2}No me di cuenta que me gustaba,\N hasta que me ayudó a cruzar el río.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:31.84,0:23:36.31,AoHaru,,0,480,0,,{He's really kind and he makes my heart race,}{}Es muy agradable,\N y hace que mi corazón se acelere,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:36.31,0:23:38.98,AoHaru,,0,480,0,,{but more than that, he's reliable.}pero más que eso, es confiable.
